{"seq":4,"slug":"first-skill-and-claude-code-bundle","title":"Hermes 第一个 skill 与 claude-code bundle","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/hermes/first-skill-and-claude-code-bundle","wordCount":1047,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"hermes-第一个-skill-与-claude-code-bundle\">Hermes 第一个 skill 与 claude-code bundle</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hermes 的 skill 是 frontmatter + markdown 的本地文件，写起来比 OpenAI function 简单一个量级。本节按&quot;自创第一个 skill → 测试触发 → 启用 bundled <code>claude-code</code> skill → 验证 delegate 链路&quot;四步走完，目标是让读者拿到两个能跑的 skill：一个完全自己写、一个用官方 bundle。两个 skill 一起跑通后，Hermes 与 Claude Code 的协同范式就建立了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  start[开始] --&gt; new[hermes skill new]&#10;  new --&gt; meta[编辑 frontmatter]&#10;  meta --&gt; body[编辑 body 内容]&#10;  body --&gt; test[hermes skill test]&#10;  test --&gt; live[live 触发验证]&#10;  live --&gt; bundle[启用 claude-code bundle]&#10;  bundle --&gt; delegate[验证 delegate 链路]\">flowchart LR\n  start[开始] --&gt; new[hermes skill new]\n  new --&gt; meta[编辑 frontmatter]\n  meta --&gt; body[编辑 body 内容]\n  body --&gt; test[hermes skill test]\n  test --&gt; live[live 触发验证]\n  live --&gt; bundle[启用 claude-code bundle]\n  bundle --&gt; delegate[验证 delegate 链路]</pre><h2 id=\"自创第一个-skill-起脚手架\">自创第一个 skill：起脚手架</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes skill new my-style-guide\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> skill</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-style-guide</span></span></code></pre></div><p>命令会生成一份脚手架文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"~/.learnwy/hermes/skills/my-style-guide/&#10;  SKILL.md\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>~/.learnwy/hermes/skills/my-style-guide/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  SKILL.md</span></span></code></pre></div><p>脚手架内容大致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;name: my-style-guide&#10;description: &lt;一句话描述 skill 用途&gt;&#10;trigger:&#10;  - &lt;触发词或短语 1&gt;&#10;  - &lt;触发词或短语 2&gt;&#10;version: 0.1.0&#10;author: &lt;你&gt;&#10;---&#10;&#10;# &lt;skill 名&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;在这里写 skill body：规范 / 步骤 / 示例 / 反例&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-style-guide</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;一句话描述 skill 用途></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;触发词或短语 1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;触发词或短语 2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">author</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;你></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># &#x3C;skill 名></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;在这里写 skill body：规范 / 步骤 / 示例 / 反例></span></span></code></pre></div><p>frontmatter 三个字段是关键：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>写法建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>name</code></td>\n<td>skill 唯一 ID</td>\n<td>全小写连字符，如 <code>my-style-guide</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>description</code></td>\n<td>一句话用途</td>\n<td>让 agent 读了能判断&quot;该不该用&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>trigger</code></td>\n<td>触发短语列表</td>\n<td>具体到项目 / 工具 / 文件类型，避免太通用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一个具体-skill-的完整例子\">一个具体 skill 的完整例子</h2><p>把脚手架补成&quot;项目 X 的 coding style guide&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;name: project-x-style&#10;description: Project X 内部 coding style 规范，用于代码生成与 review&#10;trigger:&#10;  - &#39;project-x&#39;&#10;  - &#39;项目 X&#39;&#10;  - &#39;X 项目&#39;&#10;  - &#39;/path/to/repo/project-x&#39;&#10;version: 0.1.0&#10;author: wangyang&#10;---&#10;&#10;# Project X Coding Style&#10;&#10;## 缩进与命名&#10;&#10;- 缩进：4 空格，禁 tab&#10;- 文件名：snake_case&#10;- 变量名：camelCase&#10;- 常量：UPPER_SNAKE&#10;- React 组件：PascalCase&#10;&#10;## Commit message&#10;&#10;强制 Conventional Commits 格式：&#10;&#10;type(scope): subject&#10;&#10;body&#10;&#10;footer&#10;&#10;`type` 限定枚举：feat / fix / refactor / docs / test / chore。&#10;&#10;## PR description&#10;&#10;必含三段：Summary / Test plan / Risk。test plan 必含至少一项 manual 验证。&#10;&#10;## 反例&#10;&#10;- 不要 `git add -A`，永远用具体路径&#10;- 不要 commit `.env`&#10;- 不要在 PR 里写 `@here` style mention\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">project-x-style</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Project X 内部 coding style 规范，用于代码生成与 review</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'project-x'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'项目 X'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'X 项目'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/path/to/repo/project-x'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">author</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">wangyang</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># Project X Coding Style</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 缩进与命名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 缩进：4 空格，禁 tab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 文件名：snake_case</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 变量名：camelCase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 常量：UPPER_SNAKE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> React 组件：PascalCase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Commit message</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">强制 Conventional Commits 格式：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">type(scope): subject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">footer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`type`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 限定枚举：feat / fix / refactor / docs / test / chore。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## PR description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">必含三段：Summary / Test plan / Risk。test plan 必含至少一项 manual 验证。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 反例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 不要 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`git add -A`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">，永远用具体路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 不要 commit </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`.env`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 不要在 PR 里写 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`@here`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> style mention</span></span></code></pre></div><p>写完后让 Hermes 重新扫描 skill 目录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes skill reload&#10;hermes skill list\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> skill</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reload</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> skill</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出能看到 <code>project-x-style</code> 在列表里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试触发\">测试触发</h2><p>不真启 coding agent，先用 dry-run / mock fire 验证 skill 触发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes skill test --skill project-x-style --prompt &quot;帮我写一个 project-x 的新组件&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> skill</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --skill</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> project-x-style</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prompt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"帮我写一个 project-x 的新组件\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出大致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"trigger-match: &quot;project-x&quot;&#10;matched-position: prompt[6:15]&#10;would-inject: ~/.learnwy/hermes/skills/project-x-style/SKILL.md&#10;estimated-tokens: 312\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>trigger-match: \"project-x\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>matched-position: prompt[6:15]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>would-inject: ~/.learnwy/hermes/skills/project-x-style/SKILL.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>estimated-tokens: 312</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>would-inject</code> 表示该 skill 会被注入到 coding agent 的上下文；<code>estimated-tokens</code> 帮助评估 prompt budget。</p>\n<h2 id=\"live-触发验证\">live 触发验证</h2><p>启动 mcp-serve（如未启动），然后在 Claude Code 里说一句包含 trigger 的话：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes mcp-serve &amp;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mcp-serve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Claude Code 里：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&gt; 帮我写一个 project-x 的新组件\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>> 帮我写一个 project-x 的新组件</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Claude Code 通过反向 MCP 调 <code>hermes.skill.list</code> 拿到 <code>project-x-style</code> 后，因 trigger 命中自动调 <code>hermes.skill.dispatch(skill=&#39;project-x-style&#39;)</code> 拉 body 注入上下文，再生成代码时遵循该 style guide。</p>\n<h2 id=\"启用-bundled-claude-code-skill\">启用 bundled <code>claude-code</code> skill</h2><p>Hermes 二进制内置的 bundled skill 在 init 时已经放到 <code>~/.learnwy/hermes/skills/claude-code/</code>，但默认 <code>enabled: false</code>——避免在用户没装 Claude CLI 时无声失败。手动启用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes skill enable claude-code\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> skill</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> enable</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> claude-code</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启用后看一眼 <code>~/.learnwy/hermes/skills/claude-code/SKILL.md</code> 的关键 frontmatter：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"---&#10;name: claude-code&#10;description: Delegate coding tasks to Claude Code CLI&#10;trigger:&#10;  - &#39;写代码&#39;&#10;  - &#39;implement&#39;&#10;  - &#39;重构&#39;&#10;  - &#39;调试&#39;&#10;  - &#39;write code&#39;&#10;  - &#39;refactor&#39;&#10;  - &#39;debug&#39;&#10;bundled: true&#10;enabled: true&#10;delegate:&#10;  command: claude&#10;  args: [&#39;-p&#39;]&#10;  io: stdio&#10;---\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">claude-code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Delegate coding tasks to Claude Code CLI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'写代码'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'implement'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'重构'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'调试'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'write code'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refactor'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'debug'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">bundled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">delegate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">claude</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-p'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  io</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stdio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>delegate</code> 段是 bundled skill 特有字段——告诉 Hermes 命中时不要把 body 注入上下文，而是 fork 一个子进程跑 Claude Code CLI。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bundled-skill-的-delegate-工作机制\">bundled skill 的 delegate 工作机制</h2><p>完整的 delegate 链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  user[用户在 Hermes 里说写代码 X]&#10;  user --&gt; trigger[trigger 命中 claude-code]&#10;  trigger --&gt; fork[Hermes fork 子进程]&#10;  fork --&gt; claude[claude CLI -p]&#10;  claude --&gt;|stdin| ctx[传入上下文]&#10;  claude --&gt;|stdout| ret[返回结果]&#10;  ret --&gt; hermes[Hermes 接结果]&#10;  hermes --&gt; mem[关键决策回写 memory]&#10;  hermes --&gt; user2[展示给用户]\">flowchart LR\n  user[用户在 Hermes 里说写代码 X]\n  user --&gt; trigger[trigger 命中 claude-code]\n  trigger --&gt; fork[Hermes fork 子进程]\n  fork --&gt; claude[claude CLI -p]\n  claude --&gt;|stdin| ctx[传入上下文]\n  claude --&gt;|stdout| ret[返回结果]\n  ret --&gt; hermes[Hermes 接结果]\n  hermes --&gt; mem[关键决策回写 memory]\n  hermes --&gt; user2[展示给用户]</pre><p>具体到代码层面：Hermes 用 <code>child_process.spawn(&#39;claude&#39;, [&#39;-p&#39;])</code>、把整理好的 prompt 通过 stdin 喂入、收 stdout 作为 Claude 的回答、解析其中的关键 decision 段并调 <code>memory.write</code> 写回 Hermes。</p>\n<p>这套机制让 Hermes <strong>不必自己做编程任务</strong>——它把 coding 交给最专业的工具，自己专心做 memory + skill 的长期资产维护。这是 Tier 2 工具与 Tier 1 工具的范式样板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bundled-vs-自创-skill-的差异\">bundled vs 自创 skill 的差异</h2><p>写完两个 skill 后，可以横向对比看清边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>自创 skill</th>\n<th>bundled <code>claude-code</code> skill</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源</td>\n<td>用户写</td>\n<td>Hermes 二进制内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为</td>\n<td>body 注入上下文</td>\n<td>fork 子进程 delegate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置可改</td>\n<td>全部可改</td>\n<td>只能改 trigger / enable，不能改 delegate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级</td>\n<td>用户手维护</td>\n<td>跟 Hermes 二进制升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨设备</td>\n<td>通过 git submodule 同步</td>\n<td>每台机器各自启用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>coding style / 团队规范</td>\n<td>delegate 给专业 coding agent</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"验证两个-skill-一起工作\">验证两个 skill 一起工作</h2><p>写完两个 skill 后做一次组合验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&gt; 帮我用 project-x 的 style 写一个组件\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>> 帮我用 project-x 的 style 写一个组件</span></span></code></pre></div><p>期望行为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Hermes 检测 prompt 命中 <code>project-x-style</code>（trigger &quot;project-x&quot;）和 <code>claude-code</code>（trigger &quot;写&quot;）。</li>\n<li>优先级处理：<code>project-x-style</code> 是上下文注入型、<code>claude-code</code> 是 delegate 型——Hermes 先把 <code>project-x-style</code> body 注入到 delegate prompt 里。</li>\n<li>fork <code>claude -p</code>，子进程拿到带 style guide 的 prompt，生成符合规范的代码。</li>\n<li>结果回到 Hermes，关键决策写 memory。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种&quot;上下文注入 skill + delegate skill&quot;的组合范式可复用到所有协同场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>trigger 写得太通用</strong>：写&quot;code&quot; / &quot;function&quot; 这种词，每次都激活，agent 上下文被无关 skill 撑爆；trigger 要具体到项目名 / 工具名 / 文件路径。</li>\n<li><strong>skill body 写太长</strong>：单 SKILL.md 建议 &lt; 2000 tokens；超过的拆 reference 文件，body 里只放索引。</li>\n<li><strong>bundled <code>claude-code</code> 启用前没装 claude CLI</strong>：trigger 命中后 fork 失败，错误日志写在 <code>audit/</code>；先 <code>which claude</code> 确认。</li>\n<li><strong>delegate 时未限制 PATH / cwd</strong>：子进程继承环境会引入意外副作用；生产建议用 <code>delegate.env</code> / <code>delegate.cwd</code> 显式限制。</li>\n<li><strong>以为 enable 后立刻生效</strong>：trigger 列表是 mcp-serve 启动时加载的；改 SKILL.md 后要 <code>hermes skill reload</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自创 skill：frontmatter (name/description/trigger) + markdown body，放 <code>~/.learnwy/hermes/skills/&lt;name&gt;/SKILL.md</code>。</li>\n<li>测试用 <code>hermes skill test</code>，live 用 mcp-serve 跑通后在 Claude Code 里输 trigger phrase。</li>\n<li>bundled <code>claude-code</code> skill 是官方 delegate 入口，承认 Claude Code 在 coding 领域专业性。</li>\n<li>delegate 机制：fork <code>claude -p</code>、stdio 传上下文、回写关键决策到 memory。</li>\n<li>自创 + bundled 组合：上下文注入型 skill 与 delegate 型 skill 可叠加使用。</li>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"seven-terminal-backends\"><code>5_seven-terminal-backends.md</code></a> 看 7 种 terminal 后端横向对比。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Hermes 第一个 skill 与 claude-code bundle","id":"hermes-第一个-skill-与-claude-code-bundle"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自创第一个 skill：起脚手架","id":"自创第一个-skill-起脚手架"},{"level":2,"text":"一个具体 skill 的完整例子","id":"一个具体-skill-的完整例子"},{"level":2,"text":"测试触发","id":"测试触发"},{"level":2,"text":"live 触发验证","id":"live-触发验证"},{"level":2,"text":"启用 bundled `claude-code` skill","id":"启用-bundled-claude-code-skill"},{"level":2,"text":"bundled skill 的 delegate 工作机制","id":"bundled-skill-的-delegate-工作机制"},{"level":2,"text":"bundled vs 自创 skill 的差异","id":"bundled-vs-自创-skill-的差异"},{"level":2,"text":"验证两个 skill 一起工作","id":"验证两个-skill-一起工作"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Hermes 安装与 memory 初始化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/hermes/install-and-memory-init"},"next":{"title":"Hermes 7 种 terminal 后端","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/hermes/seven-terminal-backends"}}